<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - Velcorix" description="How the Velcorix website collects and handles information, including messages sent to the website assistant.">
<!-- Page Header -->
    <PageHeader 
      title="Privacy Policy" 
      subtitle="What information this website collects, and what happens to it." 
      bgImage="assets/images/hero/DSC_2378.JPG" 
    />

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-lg-9">
            <p class="text-muted">Last updated: 4 August 2026</p>

            <h2 class="mt-4 mb-3">Who we are</h2>
            <p>
              Velcorix is a mechanical trading and consultancy firm based in
              Dubai, United Arab Emirates, providing oil and gas services,
              industrial equipment rentals, shutdown management and EPC
              advisory. This policy covers the website at www.velcorix.com.
            </p>
            <!-- TODO: add the registered company name and full registered address here before this is treated as final. -->
            <p>
              If you have any question about this policy, or about information
              we hold about you, write to
              <a href="mailto:info@velcorix.com">info@velcorix.com</a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">What we collect</h2>
            <p>We collect three kinds of information, and no more than that.</p>
            <ul>
              <li class="mb-2">
                <strong>What you send us through the contact form.</strong> Your
                name, email address, phone number and the message you write. You
                choose what to put in it.
              </li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                <strong>What you type into the website assistant.</strong> The
                chat window on this site records the messages you send it so it
                can reply. See the section below, because those messages leave
                our website.
              </li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                <strong>Basic technical information.</strong> Your IP address,
                browser type and the pages you visit. Our hosting provider
                records this automatically, and we use your IP address to limit
                how many chat messages can be sent in a short period, which
                stops the assistant being abused.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We do not ask for, and this website has no way to collect, payment
              card details, passport or Emirates ID numbers, or any other
              identity documents.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">The website assistant and Google</h2>
            <p>
              The chat window on this site is powered by Google's Gemini API.
              This matters, so we want to be plain about it:
              <strong>
                the messages you type into that window are sent to Google to
                generate a reply.
              </strong>
              They are processed on Google's systems, which are located outside
              the United Arab Emirates, and are subject to Google's own terms
              and privacy practices in addition to this policy.
            </p>
            <p>
              Because of that, please do not type anything confidential,
              commercially sensitive, or personal about yourself or anyone else
