              <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, WhatsApp, or email, where
              your message comes to us directly.
            </p>
            <p>
              We do not use anything typed into the assistant to build a profile
              of you, and we do not connect it to your contact form submissions.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Why we use your information</h2>
            <ul>
              <li class="mb-2">To answer your enquiry and provide a quotation.</li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                To supply the services or equipment you ask about, and to
                communicate with you about them.
              </li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                To keep the website working, secure, and free from abuse.
              </li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                To meet legal and regulatory obligations that apply to us.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We do not sell your information. We do not share it with anyone for
              their own marketing.
            </p>

