            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
            <p>
              This website does not set cookies of its own, and there is no
              advertising or tracking on it. The third-party services listed
              above may set cookies of their own when your browser contacts
              them. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings;
              the site will still work.
            </p>
            <p>
              If we add website analytics in future, we will update this policy
              before doing so.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">How long we keep it</h2>
            <p>
              Enquiries and the correspondence that follows are kept for as long
              as we are dealing with you, and afterwards for as long as we need
              them for our business records or to meet a legal obligation.
              Server logs are kept for a short period only. Chat messages are
              not stored on our systems after the conversation ends ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â closing
              the chat window clears it.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Your rights</h2>
            <p>
              Under the United Arab Emirates Personal Data Protection Law
              (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021) you may ask us to:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li class="mb-2">tell you what information we hold about you;</li>
              <li class="mb-2">correct it if it is wrong or incomplete;</li>
              <li class="mb-2">delete it, where we have no reason to keep it;</li>
              <li class="mb-2">
                stop using it for a particular purpose, or withdraw a consent you
                have given;
              </li>
              <li class="mb-2">provide it in a portable form.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              To exercise any of these, email
              <a href="mailto:info@velcorix.com">info@velcorix.com</a>. We will
              respond as soon as we reasonably can. If you are contacting us from
              outside the UAE, tell us and we will handle your request under the
              rules that apply to you.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Security</h2>
            <p>
              This website is served over an encrypted connection, and access to
              enquiries we receive is limited to the people at Velcorix who need
              it. No website can promise perfect security, which is another
              reason not to send sensitive documents or identity details through
              this site.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Children</h2>
            <p>
              This website is aimed at businesses and is not intended for
              children. We do not knowingly collect information about anyone
              under 18.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
              If we change how this website handles information, we will update
              this page and change the date at the top. Where the change is
              significant, we will say so clearly rather than quietly amend it.
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Contact</h2>
            <p>
              Velcorix<br />
